  "title": "Sammaan Capital joins gold loan push by large NBFCs, to launch in 16 branches in Q3",
  "summary": "After Tata Capital, Aditya Birla Finance and Godrej Finance, IHC-backed upper-layer NBFC Sammaan Capital is also entering the gold loan market as it looks to diversify beyond mortgages. “We will soft launch the product across around 16 branches in Q3 FY27, followed by another 30 branches in Q4,” said its Chief Operating Officer Sachin Chaudhary.",
